WEBVTT

00:20.850 --> 00:26.820
If I was dreaming, how did I forget?

00:26.890 --> 00:30.660
It pulsed through me, frigid, shocked me

00:30.660 --> 00:32.300
Can I do, do?

00:32.960 --> 00:37.960
I want you next to me when I summon you

00:39.130 --> 00:42.970
Waiting close by, but you seem far off

00:42.970 --> 00:45.310
Na, na, na, knight

00:45.310 --> 00:48.480
The more beautiful the rose

00:48.480 --> 00:51.450
The more its thorns hurt

00:51.450 --> 00:54.720
Now that I'm strong

00:54.720 --> 00:59.720
My heart knows to protect that vow

01:00.720 --> 01:03.760
Let's meet in the dark of night

01:03.760 --> 01:06.830
Where you're waiting

01:06.830 --> 01:09.830
You'll worship the cruel Dark Queen

01:09.830 --> 01:13.000
Who's drunk with danger

01:13.000 --> 01:15.970
You shattered the glass sword

01:15.970 --> 01:18.940
You wielded without thinking

01:18.940 --> 01:21.880
Its shards glow in the night

01:21.880 --> 01:25.350
I lick your wounded fingers

01:34.890 --> 01:39.430
Sorry to keep you waiting, Mistress.
Dinner is ready.

01:39.430 --> 01:41.070
Huh?

01:41.700 --> 01:43.340
Mistress?

01:43.770 --> 01:46.070
Hiro and Liza?

01:46.070 --> 01:50.780
Reiri and Flan, too.
Where did everyone go?

02:03.590 --> 02:06.570
The princess should be arriving soon.

02:08.160 --> 02:10.760
A small town in the mountains...

02:10.760 --> 02:13.570
You're sure this is the place,
right, you guys?

02:15.330 --> 02:19.640
The place where the princess's brother,
the one who brought the android, is.

02:20.040 --> 02:23.680
Oh? It appears she has arrived.

02:32.010 --> 02:35.000
There's no one in town.

02:44.190 --> 02:47.160
You're sure that abandoned factory
is the place, right, Reiri?

02:47.160 --> 02:50.430
Yes, Princess, according to the bats,

02:50.430 --> 02:53.930
it's where the prince who
brought the android is located.

02:53.940 --> 02:58.270
One of your siblings, huh?
Could it be Emile?

02:58.270 --> 02:59.610
It's not him.

02:59.610 --> 03:01.380
How do you know that?

03:01.380 --> 03:04.690
We'd spot Flanders from a mile away.

03:07.120 --> 03:09.120
That's a good point.

03:09.120 --> 03:10.720
It's someone else.

03:10.720 --> 03:11.850
Someone else?

03:11.850 --> 03:15.790
Looking at what Reiri's bats told her,

03:15.790 --> 03:20.790
it's probably the one who sent Duke Dracul
and the immortal werewolf warriors.

03:21.830 --> 03:23.470
And...

03:29.840 --> 03:31.480
Nothing.

03:34.810 --> 03:36.450
Hime?

03:36.550 --> 03:39.120
I could care less about the royal throne,

03:39.350 --> 03:41.880
but he's someone I have to defeat.

03:43.150 --> 03:46.130
Someone you have to defeat?

03:46.760 --> 03:48.120
Let's go.

03:48.120 --> 03:49.660
Wait, Hime.

03:49.660 --> 03:51.560
You stay here with Flandre.

03:51.560 --> 03:53.540
The three of us will go.

03:53.660 --> 03:55.630
What? With this bitch?

03:55.630 --> 03:58.200
You're a freeloader, too, so help out some!

04:00.200 --> 04:04.210
Royalty shouldn't go in themselves.
You stay here.

04:04.210 --> 04:05.470
Liza...

04:05.470 --> 04:09.410
If we're not back in thirty minutes
consider us dead.

04:09.410 --> 04:14.050
I'm prepared to get revenge on the member of
the Royal Family who killed my brother!

04:48.250 --> 04:50.560
There's no one here.

04:51.650 --> 04:53.290
Hiro!

04:58.590 --> 04:59.990
Who the hell are you?

05:00.000 --> 05:02.740
She doesn't look like a friend.

05:17.950 --> 05:19.850
Th..That's...

05:19.850 --> 05:22.180
A sonic boom?

05:22.180 --> 05:23.990
Reiri, you idiot!

05:25.050 --> 05:26.860
Damn you!

05:28.390 --> 05:30.160
She's fast!

05:30.160 --> 05:33.730
My, my, you don't seem
too bright yourself, bitch.

05:35.200 --> 05:37.440
Like you're one to talk!

05:40.000 --> 05:42.850
I hate to admit it, but she's strong.

05:44.470 --> 05:46.450
If I attack from behind...

05:56.020 --> 05:59.650
You've got some incredible skill.

05:59.650 --> 06:01.630
I'm surprised.

06:04.760 --> 06:07.400
Liza... Reiri...

06:18.270 --> 06:20.310
There's something here?

06:25.110 --> 06:26.920
Damn monster!

06:27.950 --> 06:30.260
Your opponent is right here.

06:33.720 --> 06:35.700
Don't take us lightly!

06:44.970 --> 06:46.600
She's...

06:47.470 --> 06:52.470
If there's an immortal soldier here, then that
must mean Royalty is nearby, huh?

06:52.740 --> 06:55.840
If she wasn't abandoned by her master, that is...

06:55.840 --> 06:57.480
Liza.

06:58.680 --> 06:59.810
You ain't getting away!

06:59.810 --> 07:01.620
Leave her!

07:02.280 --> 07:08.200
She'll just keep reviving
until her Flame of Life runs out.

07:09.590 --> 07:11.430
What is that?

07:27.180 --> 07:30.650
I have a bad, bad feeling about this.

07:58.140 --> 07:59.950
Get away from us!

08:04.550 --> 08:05.850
What are these things?

08:05.850 --> 08:07.830
What the hell's going on?!

08:08.820 --> 08:10.150
Zombies!

08:10.150 --> 08:11.960
So, it is him.

08:17.960 --> 08:19.600
Huga.

08:20.900 --> 08:23.710
This town's become Hell itself.

08:24.370 --> 08:26.180
Hell itself...

08:33.940 --> 08:35.540
Sorry, Hime.

08:35.540 --> 08:39.950
We were deep in battle with an immortal
soldier, but we let her get away.

08:39.950 --> 08:43.780
Hime, something really strange was in there.

08:43.790 --> 08:46.460
It seemed human, but it wasn't.

08:47.020 --> 08:48.860
We're going home.

08:48.860 --> 08:52.670
The situation has changed.
We need to escape this town at once.

08:56.930 --> 08:58.570
Huga!

09:00.800 --> 09:02.610
My, the truck...

09:04.470 --> 09:06.110
Master...

09:07.440 --> 09:10.740
You said you fought an immortal
soldier, right, Liza?

09:10.750 --> 09:12.150
Is this the time to be calm?!

09:12.150 --> 09:14.750
There was no one else there, right?

09:14.750 --> 09:16.480
Right!

09:16.480 --> 09:17.650
I see...

09:17.650 --> 09:19.630
Keep it with the group!

09:20.690 --> 09:22.620
They're buying time.

09:22.620 --> 09:28.440
They expected us to attack
the abandoned factory.

09:29.160 --> 09:31.700
While you were fighting off the immortal soldier,

09:31.700 --> 09:35.670
they released zombies into the town
to cut off our escape route.

09:36.470 --> 09:37.810
Princess!

09:37.810 --> 09:38.810
What?

09:38.810 --> 09:40.870
Did you just say zombies?

09:40.880 --> 09:42.680
I did.

09:42.680 --> 09:46.780
The ones who keep infecting more and more
people so they become zombies too?

09:46.780 --> 09:47.850
Yes.

09:47.850 --> 09:52.850
The ones that are forbidden,
without exception, for Royalty to use?

09:53.290 --> 09:54.930
Yes.

09:55.260 --> 09:59.460
Is there really someone in the Royal Family
who would use such horrific creatures?

09:59.460 --> 10:02.560
I don't see a lot of difference between
zombies and vampires.

10:02.560 --> 10:06.570
Hey! It's not fair to put us
on the same level as zombies!

10:07.040 --> 10:11.740
Well then, Princess, I will take my leave now.

10:11.740 --> 10:13.610
What?! Reiri?!

10:13.610 --> 10:17.110
It's disgraceful for a vampire
to do battle with zombies.

10:17.110 --> 10:18.610
Oh, just the thought makes me sick!

10:18.610 --> 10:20.950
Damn you, Reiri! Escaping?

10:20.950 --> 10:22.880
A real freeloader you are!

10:22.880 --> 10:26.590
Drop it, that's just how vampires are.

10:27.920 --> 10:30.330
Princess, Hiro, Liza...

10:32.060 --> 10:34.400
I wish you the best of luck.

10:36.200 --> 10:38.010
Take care.

10:58.590 --> 11:00.220
Huga.

11:01.820 --> 11:05.970
This is awful, we're already
surrounded by zombies.

11:06.690 --> 11:09.400
I forbid you to fight them hand-to-hand.

11:09.400 --> 11:13.540
If you're wounded, you'll become
one of them in no time.

11:14.670 --> 11:18.140
Whatever, though it's not my style
to fight with a weapon.

11:19.310 --> 11:21.440
Attack if you're gonna attack.

11:21.440 --> 11:23.390
Ah! Damn!

11:28.020 --> 11:30.900
Huga..ga..ga...

11:33.620 --> 11:36.820
Hey, Flandre stopped moving.

11:36.820 --> 11:38.800
Her battery ran out.

11:39.160 --> 11:43.100
Hold on a sec!
In the middle of this deathtrap?!

11:43.100 --> 11:46.540
Do you know how many tons she weighs?!
We'll never move her!

11:47.800 --> 11:49.740
A supermarket?

11:49.740 --> 11:52.270
Listen when I'm talking to you!

11:57.610 --> 12:01.820
Is everything you said true, Vampire?

12:01.820 --> 12:03.800
Please call me Reiri.

12:04.650 --> 12:11.190
I swear upon the trust you've
displayed me by inviting me in

12:12.860 --> 12:16.210
that everything I say is the truth,
Princess Sherwood.

12:17.370 --> 12:21.440
Zombies... So, the rumor is true.

12:21.440 --> 12:23.070
Huga.

12:23.840 --> 12:27.670
They said that the reason
my sister lost everything

12:27.680 --> 12:32.150
was because one of my siblings broke the rules
and encroached on her territory

12:32.150 --> 12:34.060
through the use of zombies.

12:35.080 --> 12:38.060
You've done well. You may leave now.

12:38.890 --> 12:40.690
Please excuse me, then.

12:40.690 --> 12:42.120
Oh, Reiri.

12:42.120 --> 12:43.190
Hmm?

12:43.190 --> 12:45.570
Why did you come to tell me this?

12:53.870 --> 12:57.640
So, how long does Flandre take to recharge?

12:57.640 --> 12:59.450
Let's see...

13:01.080 --> 13:03.810
She should be finished by sun-up.

13:03.810 --> 13:07.450
Then we'll restart her and make our escape

13:11.220 --> 13:13.830
So, we're stuck till then, huh?

13:38.150 --> 13:40.130
Is that you, Mikasa?

13:40.750 --> 13:42.390
Master...

13:43.790 --> 13:47.490
You did well to escape unscathed.
You're a tenacious one.

13:48.660 --> 13:51.540
Yes, Master.

13:52.660 --> 13:54.640
Did you meet my younger sister?

14:08.280 --> 14:10.950
My beloved younger sister?

14:19.950 --> 14:22.390
The zombies are growing in number.

14:22.390 --> 14:26.290
Has the entire town turned into zombies already?

14:26.290 --> 14:31.000
Hey, Hime, it's cool that we're gonna
leave when Flandre's recharged,

14:31.000 --> 14:33.130
but can we really leave things like this?

14:33.130 --> 14:35.840
What if the situation goes past
the breaking point?

14:35.840 --> 14:37.200
Everything will be fine.

14:37.210 --> 14:39.190
How can you say that?

14:40.210 --> 14:43.620
It's such a ruckus already, so it's probably...

14:46.310 --> 14:47.980
Huga.

14:47.980 --> 14:49.520
Did you spot her, Franz?

14:49.520 --> 14:51.160
Huga.

14:51.950 --> 14:55.820
Mikasa, go back to that hell again.

14:55.820 --> 14:57.800
Defeat my sister.

14:59.190 --> 15:03.040
What's wrong? Are you not my immortal soldier?

15:03.160 --> 15:08.080
Come, I'll grant you the Flame of Life.

15:18.480 --> 15:21.950
Do you hate me, Mikasa?

15:21.950 --> 15:24.330
I do not, Master.

15:26.750 --> 15:31.660
I killed you, brought you back to life,
and gave you that body of yours.

15:31.660 --> 15:33.970
So, how can you still ingratiate yourself to me?

15:37.070 --> 15:41.840
You're absolutely shameless, Mikasa.
To think you love me so much...

15:54.350 --> 15:55.820
She should be good now.

15:55.820 --> 15:58.920
All right! We just need to restart Flandre

15:58.920 --> 16:00.730
Let's go, Hiro!

16:01.690 --> 16:05.160
Just as I thought, the coast is clear.

16:10.970 --> 16:13.500
What is it, Liza?

16:13.500 --> 16:16.670
Hiro, can I trust Flandre to you?

16:16.670 --> 16:17.670
Huh?

16:17.670 --> 16:19.310
She's back.

16:19.310 --> 16:20.670
She?

16:20.680 --> 16:25.680
Hiro, protect the princess
with everything you've got.

16:25.950 --> 16:28.660
Her life is in your hands.

16:29.450 --> 16:31.090
Liza!

16:31.290 --> 16:32.320
Let's go.

16:32.320 --> 16:34.130
Huh? But...

16:51.640 --> 16:55.640
So, it is you, your scent gave you away.

16:57.580 --> 16:59.980
I'm Liza Wildman,

16:59.980 --> 17:03.430
daughter of the almighty warrior, Worg Wildman.

17:04.350 --> 17:08.490
I'm Mikasa. Do you think you can beat me?

17:09.790 --> 17:12.570
I'll show you something neat.

17:23.270 --> 17:25.080
Bring it!

17:35.580 --> 17:37.650
You ain't seen nothin' yet!

17:51.270 --> 17:54.770
Hime, I will protect you.

17:54.770 --> 17:56.580
It's my duty!

18:04.680 --> 18:06.320
Huga.

18:09.250 --> 18:11.520
Where is that sister of mine?

18:11.520 --> 18:13.500
I hope she's unharmed.

18:17.490 --> 18:19.300
Over there?

18:19.560 --> 18:21.390
Hurry, Francesca!

18:21.400 --> 18:23.030
Huga.

18:27.800 --> 18:29.610
The on switch...

18:31.410 --> 18:34.910
Wh..Where is it? Where... Where?!

18:42.020 --> 18:44.020
Hiro, hurry up.

18:44.020 --> 18:47.360
But I can't tell what's what!

18:53.630 --> 18:55.270
Hime!

19:01.170 --> 19:03.940
Sister!

19:03.940 --> 19:05.580
Sherwood?

19:05.870 --> 19:07.680
Princess Sherwood!

19:11.350 --> 19:13.910
Hiro! What do you think you're doing?!

19:13.920 --> 19:15.420
That's immoral, and at a time like this!

19:15.420 --> 19:18.250
What?! No, this is just... umm...

19:18.250 --> 19:20.950
Don't make excuses! Francesca!

19:20.960 --> 19:22.590
Huga.

19:29.460 --> 19:31.440
You're awake? Attack them.

19:31.670 --> 19:33.300
Huga!

19:43.610 --> 19:48.480
My, my, what a mess this has turned into.

19:48.480 --> 19:52.550
Battles for the throne are so unsightly.

19:52.550 --> 19:55.120
Not something you'd want to be involved in.

19:55.120 --> 19:56.660
Agreed.

19:56.660 --> 19:58.260
But, Reiri,

19:58.260 --> 20:01.430
what are you doing here then?

20:07.870 --> 20:09.510
Huga.

20:10.440 --> 20:11.910
All right.

20:11.910 --> 20:14.610
Liza, let's get out of here.

20:16.740 --> 20:18.450
You heard her.

20:18.450 --> 20:20.890
So long, immortal soldier

20:29.960 --> 20:33.760
I'm so glad you're safe, Sister.

20:33.760 --> 20:35.460
Huga.

20:35.460 --> 20:37.940
Idiot! What are you doing, Francesca?!

20:39.230 --> 20:41.510
Reiri was the one who called you here, huh?

20:42.540 --> 20:47.250
Sheesh, our brother really did it this time, huh?

20:49.280 --> 20:53.710
Yes, but he went too far this time.

20:53.710 --> 20:58.690
Involving the human world this much will mean...

21:05.230 --> 21:06.860
Huga.

21:09.100 --> 21:12.270
What... What is that?

21:50.670 --> 21:52.310
Huga.

22:12.460 --> 22:17.460
Get down on your knees and lick my red nails

22:18.030 --> 22:25.970
Call me queen with your entangled tongue

22:28.540 --> 22:31.310
The sun that blooms in Hell

22:31.310 --> 22:34.050
Darkness that's fallen to Paradise

22:34.050 --> 22:36.620
If you're confronted with light and despair

22:36.620 --> 22:39.250
Which one goes deeper?

22:39.250 --> 22:41.990
Roses fly from my head

22:41.990 --> 22:44.690
I'll scatter them into Nirvana

22:44.690 --> 22:47.290
Wounds that secretly pain you

22:47.290 --> 22:49.870
Blood that gushes away

22:49.930 --> 22:52.570
They both lead to the depths of my heart

22:52.570 --> 22:55.240
You've given these gorgeous gifts as tribute

22:55.240 --> 22:57.900
And yet you're still

22:57.910 --> 23:00.610
Seeking love?

23:00.610 --> 23:03.340
Tell me exactly to what extent

23:03.340 --> 23:06.010
Grown men are just foolish little boys?

23:06.010 --> 23:11.010
Get down on your knees and lick my sacred feet

23:11.290 --> 23:16.290
Call me queen in your hoarse voice

23:16.720 --> 23:21.720
The proof of your life creeps up the tower of pain

23:21.960 --> 23:24.660
Slowly making your way, you can barely breathe

23:24.670 --> 23:27.300
But if you still ask for it

23:27.300 --> 23:31.270
Your dying breath just might be

23:31.270 --> 23:39.560
The words that melt my frozen tears

23:40.880 --> 23:41.880
Huga.

23:41.880 --> 23:45.650
Defendant, Hiro Hiyorimi...
Do you have anything to say for yourself?

23:45.650 --> 23:48.320
I didn't do it! I'm innocent!

23:48.320 --> 23:51.120
Did you not put your hand up Flandre's skin?

23:51.130 --> 23:53.360
Sherwood witnessed the entire ordeal

23:53.360 --> 23:56.930
But I was just trying to get to Flandre's switch!

23:56.930 --> 24:01.400
The plaintiff, Flandre, is accusing you of
touching places other than her switch.

24:01.400 --> 24:02.400
Huga.

24:02.400 --> 24:04.470
C..Come on!

24:04.470 --> 24:06.470
Next episode, "Princess Duel"

24:06.470 --> 24:07.270
Get ready for the verdict, Hiro.

24:08.780 --> 24:10.760
Huga, huga.
